<title>GERMANY: NRW Sept CPI down 0.1 pct mth/mth in September.</title>
<headline>NRW Sept CPI down 0.1 pct mth/mth in September.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state statistics office in the German state of North Rhine-Westphalia reported the following consumer price changes for September.</p>
<p>    Cost of living		September	   August</p>
<p>    Month/month (pct change)  -0.1		  unch</p>
<p>    Year/year		     +1.5		  +1.6</p>
<p>NOTE - This data is combined with data from three other major German states to calculate the preliminary figure for the whole of west Germany.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
